//! Controls whether the browser can constrain a scrolling gesture to one axis. Use none when
//! diagonal scrolling must remain available.
//!
//! Initial: auto. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - auto: Allows the browser to lock a gesture to one scrolling axis.
//! - none: Keeps diagonal scrolling available by disabling axis locking.
